OL,3,GNEWSAYouth charged after shopping
OL,4,Acentre attack leaves teenager in
OL,5,Ahospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland said the 19-year-old
OL,8,Fwas taken to hospital and a 17-year-old
OL,9,Fboy was later arrested and charged
OL,10,Ffollowing investigations.
